<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#LexicalEntry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A word, term, or morpheme in a sacred language with its liturgical or ritual meaning documented. Subclass of ontolex:LexicalEntry for integration with multilingual lexicographic infrastructure. A single lexical entry may have multiple senses (iroko:LexicalSense), including restricted senses whose esoteric meaning is not disclosed publicly. The existence of a term is community-restricted; its esoteric sense is initiated-only."@en .
