<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ScriptSystemScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Àwọn ètò ìkọ̀wé mímọ́"@yo .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#SpeechActTypeScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#act-farewell> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#lang-sacred-register> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A specialized ceremonial register of a vernacular language, with vocabulary and formulas specific to sacred contexts. Examples: the Vodou ceremonial register of Haitian Kreyòl; the ceremonial Jamaican Patois of Kumina."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#nameConvention> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#minimumAccessLevel> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#access-community-only> .
