<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#hasPhrase> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#secretNameText> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#SecretName> .
