<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#partOfSpeech> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Grammatical category of this term. Range: iroko:PartOfSpeechScheme."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#pos-formula> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#PartOfSpeechScheme> .
