<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#phraseText> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text of the liturgical phrase in its original language. Language-tagged. Initiated-only."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#publicDefinition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
