<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#script-nsibidi> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The Ejagham ideographic writing system, functioning as both script and graphic sign system. Cross-listed with iroko-veve for its graphic dimension; listed here for its lexical and communicative dimension."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#languageName> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#minimumAccessLevel> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#access-public-unrestricted> .
