<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#writtenForm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The conventional written form of this term in the liturgical language. Language-tagged. Community-restricted."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#script-geez> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
