<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#naming-orisha-camino> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The secret name of a specific camino (path) of an Orisha, revealed in divination. Community-restricted in general; the specific name is initiated-elder only."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#PartOfSpeechScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#pos-adjective> .
